# ── Sstym Linux: AUR packages, built during the ISO build ──
# Only open-source packages that may be redistributed.
tor-browser-bin          # Tor Browser with built-in bridges (Snowflake, meek, obfs4, WebTunnel)
lantern-bin              # Lantern: free, automatic censorship circumvention
amneziavpn-bin           # Amnezia VPN: AmneziaWG / XRay, free "Amnezia Free" option
throne-bin               # Throne (ex-Nekoray): VLESS / Reality / Hysteria2 / Trojan / Shadowsocks
outline-client-appimage  # Outline client (Shadowsocks access keys)
localsend-bin            # LocalSend: AirDrop-style file sharing
whitesur-icon-theme      # macOS Big Sur–style icons (GPL-3.0)
whitesur-gtk-theme       # macOS-style GTK theme with traffic-light window buttons (MIT)
apple_cursor             # macOS cursor (GPL-3.0)
